<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="font-size:11pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
<div style="padding:3pt 0in 0in; border-top:1pt solid rgb(225,225,225)">
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"><b>From:</b> Robert Samuel White &lt;rsw@rswfire.com&gt;<br>
<b>Sent:</b> Saturday, September 5, 2026 3:56 PM<br>
<b>To:</b> GAUTHIER Katie * OPRD &lt;katie.gauthier@oprd.oregon.gov&gt;; PUBLICRECORDS Oprd * OPRD &lt;oprd.publicrecords@oprd.oregon.gov&gt;<br>
<b>Cc:</b> COLLIER JR * OPRD &lt;jr.collier@oprd.oregon.gov&gt;; SUMPTION Lisa * OPRD &lt;lisa.sumption@oprd.oregon.gov&gt;; PUBLICCOMMENT Oprc * OPRD &lt;oprc.publiccomment@oprd.oregon.gov&gt;; Governor Kotek * GOV &lt;governor.kotek@oregon.gov&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> Public records request under ORS 192.311 to 192.478</span></p>
</div>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">This is a request under the Oregon Public Records Law. It is narrow by design and concerns two custodians only.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">I am Robert Samuel White, date of birth April 11, 1977. I served as an unpaid volunteer with the Oregon Parks and Recreation Department at Jessie M. Honeyman
 Memorial State Park and was permanently excluded from all Department volunteer programs in a letter dated March 26, 2025.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">The period requested is February 1, 2025 to the present.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">I request the following records concerning me, held by or sent or received by Director Lisa Sumption and Deputy Director J.R. Collier.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">1. All communications concerning me sent or received by Director Lisa Sumption, in any medium, including email, text message, instant message, and any messaging
 application, on any device or account used for Department business.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">2. All communications concerning me sent or received by Deputy Director J.R. Collier, on the same terms.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">3. All communications between Director Sumption and Deputy Director Collier concerning me.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">For the purpose of items 1 through 3, &quot;concerning me&quot; includes any communication referring to Robert White, Robert Samuel White, Robert S. White, Sam White,
</span><span style="color:rgb(70,120,134)"><a href="mailto:rsw@rswfire.com" id="OWA082662c9-0616-a3a7-d125-021beb4bbe1d" class="x_OWAAutoLink" style="color:rgb(70,120,134); margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px"><u>rsw@rswfire.com</u></a></span><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">,
 oprdvolunteerabuse.org, rswfire.com, my date of birth, my volunteer service, my dismissal, my exclusion, my correspondence, my public records requests, the March 24, 2026 law enforcement contact at my residence, or the legal fund I have opened.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">4. All notes, memoranda, summaries, or other records authored by either individual concerning me, including handwritten notes and calendar entries.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">5. Any record reflecting a direction or instruction given by either individual concerning me, including any instruction regarding whether or how staff should
 respond to my correspondence.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">This request does not seek records held by any other Department employee. If a communication responsive to items 1 through 3 was sent to or received from another
 employee, it is responsive because Director Sumption or Deputy Director Collier is a party to it.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Administration</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Fee waiver. I request a waiver under ORS 192.324(5). Disclosure primarily benefits the general public. These records concern how the two highest officials
 of a state agency handled a documented complaint of retaliation by their own staff, and the conduct that followed. I have no commercial purpose. All records produced will be published in full, at no charge, at oprdvolunteerabuse.org.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Acknowledgment and timeline. ORS 192.324(2) requires acknowledgment or completion within five business days, and ORS 192.329(5) requires a reasonable estimated
 completion date where a response cannot be completed within fifteen business days. I request both in writing.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Fees. ORS 192.324(4) prohibits a fee exceeding $25 without prior written notice. If a fee is to be charged, I request that notice with an itemized basis before
 any work is performed, and the opportunity to narrow the request rather than have it held pending payment. I have no ability to receive or return printed forms; any fee waiver determination should not be conditioned on the return of a printed document.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Format. Electronic delivery by email or secure link, in native format with headers, recipients, timestamps, metadata, and attachments preserved and intact.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Preservation. Please treat all records responsive to this request as subject to litigation hold. I have served a notice of tort claim on the State of Oregon
 under ORS 30.275, and the Department of Administrative Services has opened claim P195403.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Disposition. For each numbered item, please state whether responsive records exist, produce them, or cite the specific exemption claimed for each record or
 portion withheld, as ORS 192.329(2) requires. If any responsive record is withheld, identify it by date, author, recipient, and subject.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">Robert Samuel White</span></p>
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"><span style="color:rgb(33,33,33)">oprdvolunteerabuse.org</span></p>
<div id="x_x_ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line">
<p style="margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
